      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
      * Cvt2CYMD - Convert date from MDYY to CYMD
      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
     D Cvt2CYMD        pr             6  0
     D  date_in                       8s 0

      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
      * CreateQue - Create a dataq
      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
     D CreateQue       pr                   extpgm('ISCRTDQ4')
     D  que                          10a
     D  lib                          10a
     D  text                         20a
     D  return_code                   1a

      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
      * CheckObj - Check for an objects existance
      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
     D CheckObj        pr                   extpgm('SRCHKOBJ')
     D  object                       10a
     D  type                          7a
     D  return_code                   1a

